Policy: https://kids.airdroid.info/#/Privacy<br>Terms of Service: https://kids.airdroid.info/#/Eula<br>Payment Terms: https://kids.airdroid.info/#/Payment<br><br> <br>Contact Us:<br>For any further suggestions or questions, please feel free to contact us at support@airdroid.com",
